{"id":"34f27739c5ea48f5","group":"14","path":"14/14-thm-generic-model-pseudonaturality.md","title":"Theorem — 泛模型分类的伪自然性","display":"Theorem — 泛模型分类的伪自然性","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane & Moerdijk)","book_abbrev":"14","label":"14-thm-generic-model-pseudonaturality","aliases":["14-thm-generic-model-pseudonaturality"],"display":"Theorem — 泛模型分类的伪自然性","depends_on":["[[14-df-classifying-topos]]","[[14-thm-composition-geometric-morphisms]]","[[14-df-geometric-morphism-category]]","[[14-thm-geometric-inverse-image-preserves-models]]","[[14-df-category-equivalence]]","[[14-df-model-homomorphisms-and-category]]","[[14-df-natural-transformation-composition-whiskering]]","[[14-df-identity-composite-functors]]","[[14-df-natural-isomorphism-fully-faithful-functor]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane &amp; Moerdijk)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"14"},{"key":"label","html":"14-thm-generic-model-pseudonaturality"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>14-thm-generic-model-pseudonaturality</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Theorem — 泛模型分类的伪自然性"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a76b2bc2c7b718cf\" href=\"?note=a76b2bc2c7b718cf\" title=\"14-df-classifying-topos\">14-df-classifying-topos</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a987285ba9cb0966\" href=\"?note=a987285ba9cb0966\" title=\"14-thm-composition-geometric-morphisms\">14-thm-composition-geometric-morphisms</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"9fefe9c472fa2311\" href=\"?note=9fefe9c472fa2311\" title=\"14-df-geometric-morphism-category\">14-df-geometric-morphism-category</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"6f0a11402a38ca6b\" href=\"?note=6f0a11402a38ca6b\" title=\"14-thm-geometric-inverse-image-preserves-models\">14-thm-geometric-inverse-image-preserves-models</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"c502117a84587a7c\" href=\"?note=c502117a84587a7c\" title=\"14-df-category-equivalence\">14-df-category-equivalence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"fc5aaf8518e020c2\" href=\"?note=fc5aaf8518e020c2\" title=\"14-df-model-homomorphisms-and-category\">14-df-model-homomorphisms-and-category</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"f012515fd4cf0061\" href=\"?note=f012515fd4cf0061\" title=\"14-df-natural-transformation-composition-whiskering\">14-df-natural-transformation-composition-whiskering</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"dad26c5de724390a\" href=\"?note=dad26c5de724390a\" title=\"14-df-identity-composite-functors\">14-df-identity-composite-functors</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"637a464575207be3\" href=\"?note=637a464575207be3\" title=\"14-df-natural-isomorphism-fully-faithful-functor\">14-df-natural-isomorphism-fully-faithful-functor</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 为固定签名，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb T\">\\(\\mathbb T\\)</span> 为该签名上的有穷几何理论；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal B\">\\(\\mathcal B\\)</span> 为其分类拓扑斯。固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathrm{Mod}_{\\mathbb T}(\\mathcal B))\">\\(M\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathrm{Mod}_{\\mathbb T}(\\mathcal B))\\)</span>，满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall\\mathcal H\\in\\mathcal V\\ (\\mathrm{IsGrothendieckTopos}(\\mathcal H)\\Rightarrow\\mathrm{IsEquivalence}(\\operatorname{Ev}_M^{\\mathcal H}))\">\\(\\forall\\mathcal H\\in\\mathcal V\\ (\\mathrm{IsGrothendieckTopos}(\\mathcal H)\\Rightarrow\\mathrm{IsEquivalence}(\\operatorname{Ev}_M^{\\mathcal H}))\\)</span>。所有以下拓扑斯均为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal U\">\\(\\mathcal U\\)</span>-Grothendieck 拓扑斯，每个拓扑斯的有限积选择固定为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"86c3a123f8ca1262\" href=\"?note=86c3a123f8ca1262\" title=\"14-df-many-sorted-topos-structures\">14-df-many-sorted-topos-structures</a> 的递归选择。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g,g&#39;:\\mathcal F\\to\\mathcal E\">\\(g,g&#39;:\\mathcal F\\to\\mathcal E\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h:\\mathcal G\\to\\mathcal F\">\\(h:\\mathcal G\\to\\mathcal F\\)</span> 为几何态射，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\beta\\in\\operatorname{Geom2}(g,g&#39;)\">\\(\\beta\\in\\operatorname{Geom2}(g,g&#39;)\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v^*_{\\mathrm{Mod}},v^*_{\\mathrm{Geom}},A_v,B_v,\\kappa_v^M\">\\(v^*_{\\mathrm{Mod}},v^*_{\\mathrm{Geom}},A_v,B_v,\\kappa_v^M\\)</span> 的定义统一适用于每个几何态射 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v:\\mathcal D\\to\\mathcal C\">\\(v:\\mathcal D\\to\\mathcal C\\)</span>；其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N,N&#39;\">\\(N,N&#39;\\)</span> 遍历 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Mod}_{\\mathbb T}(\\mathcal C)\">\\(\\mathrm{Mod}_{\\mathbb T}(\\mathcal C)\\)</span> 的对象，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(N,N&#39;,a)\">\\((N,N&#39;,a)\\)</span> 遍历其箭头，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f,k\">\\(f,k\\)</span> 遍历 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Geom}(\\mathcal C,\\mathcal B)\">\\(\\mathrm{Geom}(\\mathcal C,\\mathcal B)\\)</span> 的对象，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\\in\\operatorname{Geom2}(f,k)\">\\(\\alpha\\in\\operatorname{Geom2}(f,k)\\)</span>。几何态射的复合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v\\diamond f\">\\(v\\diamond f\\)</span>、自然变换的左右 whiskering、竖直复合与恒等均采用所列依赖的有源靶编码。</p>\n<p>下列比较使用已经固定的对象与有限积选择；不同拓扑斯中的对象只在实际相等的载体上使用恒等箭头。逆像结构的有限积比较由唯一的投影方程确定。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{gathered}\n\\mathbf 1^{\\mathrm{Geom}}_{\\mathcal C}\\coloneqq(1_{\\mathcal C},1_{\\mathcal C}),\\\\\nv^*_{\\mathrm{Mod}}\\coloneqq\\bigl(N\\mapsto\\operatorname{Inv}_v(N),\\ (N,N&#39;,a)\\mapsto(\\operatorname{Inv}_v(N),\\operatorname{Inv}_v(N&#39;),(v^*(a_s))_{s\\in S_0})\\bigr),\\\\\nv^*_{\\mathrm{Geom}}\\coloneqq\\bigl(f\\mapsto v\\diamond f,\\ (f,k,\\alpha)\\mapsto(v\\diamond f,v\\diamond k,v^*\\alpha)\\bigr),\\\\\n\\operatorname{IsFunctor}(v^*_{\\mathrm{Mod}},\\mathrm{Mod}_{\\mathbb T}(\\mathcal C),\\mathrm{Mod}_{\\mathbb T}(\\mathcal D)),\\\\\n\\operatorname{IsFunctor}(v^*_{\\mathrm{Geom}},\\mathrm{Geom}(\\mathcal C,\\mathcal B),\\mathrm{Geom}(\\mathcal D,\\mathcal B)),\\\\\nA_v\\coloneqq v^*_{\\mathrm{Mod}}\\circ\\operatorname{Ev}_M^{\\mathcal C},\\qquad\nB_v\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Ev}_M^{\\mathcal D}\\circ v^*_{\\mathrm{Geom}},\\qquad A_v=B_v,\\\\\n\\kappa_v^M\\coloneqq\\left(A_v,B_v,\\left(1_{A_v(f)}\\right)_{f\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathrm{Geom}(\\mathcal C,\\mathcal B))}\\right),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{IsNaturalIso}(\\kappa_v^M,A_v,B_v).\n\\end{gathered}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{gathered}\n\\mathbf 1^{\\mathrm{Geom}}_{\\mathcal C}\\coloneqq(1_{\\mathcal C},1_{\\mathcal C}),\\\\\nv^*_{\\mathrm{Mod}}\\coloneqq\\bigl(N\\mapsto\\operatorname{Inv}_v(N),\\ (N,N&#39;,a)\\mapsto(\\operatorname{Inv}_v(N),\\operatorname{Inv}_v(N&#39;),(v^*(a_s))_{s\\in S_0})\\bigr),\\\\\nv^*_{\\mathrm{Geom}}\\coloneqq\\bigl(f\\mapsto v\\diamond f,\\ (f,k,\\alpha)\\mapsto(v\\diamond f,v\\diamond k,v^*\\alpha)\\bigr),\\\\\n\\operatorname{IsFunctor}(v^*_{\\mathrm{Mod}},\\mathrm{Mod}_{\\mathbb T}(\\mathcal C),\\mathrm{Mod}_{\\mathbb T}(\\mathcal D)),\\\\\n\\operatorname{IsFunctor}(v^*_{\\mathrm{Geom}},\\mathrm{Geom}(\\mathcal C,\\mathcal B),\\mathrm{Geom}(\\mathcal D,\\mathcal B)),\\\\\nA_v\\coloneqq v^*_{\\mathrm{Mod}}\\circ\\operatorname{Ev}_M^{\\mathcal C},\\qquad\nB_v\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Ev}_M^{\\mathcal D}\\circ v^*_{\\mathrm{Geom}},\\qquad A_v=B_v,\\\\\n\\kappa_v^M\\coloneqq\\left(A_v,B_v,\\left(1_{A_v(f)}\\right)_{f\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathrm{Geom}(\\mathcal C,\\mathcal B))}\\right),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{IsNaturalIso}(\\kappa_v^M,A_v,B_v).\n\\end{gathered}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{gathered}\n(\\mathbf1^{\\mathrm{Geom}}_{\\mathcal E})^*_{\\mathrm{Mod}}=1_{\\mathrm{Mod}_{\\mathbb T}(\\mathcal E)},\\qquad\n(\\mathbf1^{\\mathrm{Geom}}_{\\mathcal E})^*_{\\mathrm{Geom}}=1_{\\mathrm{Geom}(\\mathcal E,\\mathcal B)},\\\\\n(h\\diamond g)^*_{\\mathrm{Mod}}=h^*_{\\mathrm{Mod}}\\circ g^*_{\\mathrm{Mod}},\\qquad\n(h\\diamond g)^*_{\\mathrm{Geom}}=h^*_{\\mathrm{Geom}}\\circ g^*_{\\mathrm{Geom}},\\\\\n\\kappa_{\\mathbf1^{\\mathrm{Geom}}_{\\mathcal E}}^M=1_{\\operatorname{Ev}_M^{\\mathcal E}},\\qquad\n\\kappa_{h\\diamond g}^M=(\\kappa_h^M g^*_{\\mathrm{Geom}})\\circ(h^*_{\\mathrm{Mod}}\\kappa_g^M).\n\\end{gathered}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{gathered}\n(\\mathbf1^{\\mathrm{Geom}}_{\\mathcal E})^*_{\\mathrm{Mod}}=1_{\\mathrm{Mod}_{\\mathbb T}(\\mathcal E)},\\qquad\n(\\mathbf1^{\\mathrm{Geom}}_{\\mathcal E})^*_{\\mathrm{Geom}}=1_{\\mathrm{Geom}(\\mathcal E,\\mathcal B)},\\\\\n(h\\diamond g)^*_{\\mathrm{Mod}}=h^*_{\\mathrm{Mod}}\\circ g^*_{\\mathrm{Mod}},\\qquad\n(h\\diamond g)^*_{\\mathrm{Geom}}=h^*_{\\mathrm{Geom}}\\circ g^*_{\\mathrm{Geom}},\\\\\n\\kappa_{\\mathbf1^{\\mathrm{Geom}}_{\\mathcal E}}^M=1_{\\operatorname{Ev}_M^{\\mathcal E}},\\qquad\n\\kappa_{h\\diamond g}^M=(\\kappa_h^M g^*_{\\mathrm{Geom}})\\circ(h^*_{\\mathrm{Mod}}\\kappa_g^M).\n\\end{gathered}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{gathered}\n\\beta_{\\mathrm{Mod}}\\coloneqq\\left(g^*_{\\mathrm{Mod}},(g&#39;)^*_{\\mathrm{Mod}},\n\\left((\\operatorname{Inv}_g(N),\\operatorname{Inv}_{g&#39;}(N),(\\beta_{N_s})_{s\\in S_0})\\right)_{N\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathrm{Mod}_{\\mathbb T}(\\mathcal E))}\\right),\\\\\n\\beta_{\\mathrm{Geom}}\\coloneqq\\left(g^*_{\\mathrm{Geom}},(g&#39;)^*_{\\mathrm{Geom}},\n\\left((g\\diamond f,g&#39;\\diamond f,\\beta f^*)\\right)_{f\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathrm{Geom}(\\mathcal E,\\mathcal B))}\\right),\\\\\n\\operatorname{IsNatural}(\\beta_{\\mathrm{Mod}},g^*_{\\mathrm{Mod}},(g&#39;)^*_{\\mathrm{Mod}}),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{IsNatural}(\\beta_{\\mathrm{Geom}},g^*_{\\mathrm{Geom}},(g&#39;)^*_{\\mathrm{Geom}}),\\\\\n\\kappa_{g&#39;}^M\\circ(\\beta_{\\mathrm{Mod}}\\operatorname{Ev}_M^{\\mathcal E})\n=(\\operatorname{Ev}_M^{\\mathcal F}\\beta_{\\mathrm{Geom}})\\circ\\kappa_g^M.\n\\end{gathered}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{gathered}\n\\beta_{\\mathrm{Mod}}\\coloneqq\\left(g^*_{\\mathrm{Mod}},(g&#39;)^*_{\\mathrm{Mod}},\n\\left((\\operatorname{Inv}_g(N),\\operatorname{Inv}_{g&#39;}(N),(\\beta_{N_s})_{s\\in S_0})\\right)_{N\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathrm{Mod}_{\\mathbb T}(\\mathcal E))}\\right),\\\\\n\\beta_{\\mathrm{Geom}}\\coloneqq\\left(g^*_{\\mathrm{Geom}},(g&#39;)^*_{\\mathrm{Geom}},\n\\left((g\\diamond f,g&#39;\\diamond f,\\beta f^*)\\right)_{f\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathrm{Geom}(\\mathcal E,\\mathcal B))}\\right),\\\\\n\\operatorname{IsNatural}(\\beta_{\\mathrm{Mod}},g^*_{\\mathrm{Mod}},(g&#39;)^*_{\\mathrm{Mod}}),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{IsNatural}(\\beta_{\\mathrm{Geom}},g^*_{\\mathrm{Geom}},(g&#39;)^*_{\\mathrm{Geom}}),\\\\\n\\kappa_{g&#39;}^M\\circ(\\beta_{\\mathrm{Mod}}\\operatorname{Ev}_M^{\\mathcal E})\n=(\\operatorname{Ev}_M^{\\mathcal F}\\beta_{\\mathrm{Geom}})\\circ\\kappa_g^M.\n\\end{gathered}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>逆像的底层函子以对象映射、箭头映射编码，故恒等与复合严格满足函子律。结构运输的有限积比较也与恒等、复合相容：两种候选比较在每个投影后都等于同一条箭头，由有限积泛性质相等。因此在本书这组固定选择下，两条评价复合实际相等，比较可取上述恒等分量自然同构。这是一般伪自然比较在本编码中的具体实现，不是省略一个未经指定的同构。</p>\n<p>对几何二胞，左正合函子间自然变换与有限积比较相容，因而其逐类分量保持函数和关系，给出所列模型自然变换。单位、两次换基及二胞方块的相容性均已在 Assertion 中写出；三次及更多次复合由这两次复合公式与结合律推出。仅存在各个方块上的某个自然同构不足以替代这些相容条件。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"14-df-classifying-topos","status":"resolved","id":"a76b2bc2c7b718cf","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-classifying-topos]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-thm-composition-geometric-morphisms","status":"resolved","id":"a987285ba9cb0966","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-thm-composition-geometric-morphisms]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-geometric-morphism-category","status":"resolved","id":"9fefe9c472fa2311","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-geometric-morphism-category]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-thm-geometric-inverse-image-preserves-models","status":"resolved","id":"6f0a11402a38ca6b","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-thm-geometric-inverse-image-preserves-models]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-category-equivalence","status":"resolved","id":"c502117a84587a7c","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-category-equivalence]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-model-homomorphisms-and-category","status":"resolved","id":"fc5aaf8518e020c2","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-model-homomorphisms-and-category]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-natural-transformation-composition-whiskering","status":"resolved","id":"f012515fd4cf0061","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-natural-transformation-composition-whiskering]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-identity-composite-functors","status":"resolved","id":"dad26c5de724390a","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-identity-composite-functors]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-natural-isomorphism-fully-faithful-functor","status":"resolved","id":"637a464575207be3","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-natural-isomorphism-fully-faithful-functor]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-many-sorted-topos-structures","status":"resolved","id":"86c3a123f8ca1262","anchor":"ref-10","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$S$ 为固定签名，$\\mathbb T$ 为该签名上的有穷几何理论；$\\mathcal B$ 为其分类拓扑斯。固定 $M\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathrm{Mod}_{\\mathbb T}(\\mathcal B))$，满足 $\\forall\\mathcal H\\in\\mathcal V\\ (\\mathrm{IsGrothendieckTopos}(\\mathcal H)\\Rightarrow\\mathrm{IsEquivalence}(\\operatorname{Ev}_M^{\\mathcal H}))$。所有以下拓扑斯均为 $\\mathcal U$-Grothendieck 拓扑斯，每个拓扑斯的有限积选择固定为 [[14-df-many-sorted-topos-structures]] 的递归选择。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal B","display":false},{"tex":"M\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathrm{Mod}_{\\mathbb T}(\\mathcal B))","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall\\mathcal H\\in\\mathcal V\\ (\\mathrm{IsGrothendieckTopos}(\\mathcal H)\\Rightarrow\\mathrm{IsEquivalence}(\\operatorname{Ev}_M^{\\mathcal H}))","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal U","display":false},{"tex":"g,g':\\mathcal F\\to\\mathcal E","display":false},{"tex":"h:\\mathcal G\\to\\mathcal F","display":false},{"tex":"\\beta\\in\\operatorname{Geom2}(g,g')","display":false},{"tex":"v^*_{\\mathrm{Mod}},v^*_{\\mathrm{Geom}},A_v,B_v,\\kappa_v^M","display":false},{"tex":"v:\\mathcal D\\to\\mathcal C","display":false},{"tex":"N,N'","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Mod}_{\\mathbb T}(\\mathcal C)","display":false},{"tex":"(N,N',a)","display":false},{"tex":"f,k","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Geom}(\\mathcal C,\\mathcal B)","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha\\in\\operatorname{Geom2}(f,k)","display":false},{"tex":"v\\diamond f","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{gathered}\n\\mathbf 1^{\\mathrm{Geom}}_{\\mathcal C}\\coloneqq(1_{\\mathcal C},1_{\\mathcal C}),\\\\\nv^*_{\\mathrm{Mod}}\\coloneqq\\bigl(N\\mapsto\\operatorname{Inv}_v(N),\\ (N,N',a)\\mapsto(\\operatorname{Inv}_v(N),\\operatorname{Inv}_v(N'),(v^*(a_s))_{s\\in S_0})\\bigr),\\\\\nv^*_{\\mathrm{Geom}}\\coloneqq\\bigl(f\\mapsto v\\diamond f,\\ (f,k,\\alpha)\\mapsto(v\\diamond f,v\\diamond k,v^*\\alpha)\\bigr),\\\\\n\\operatorname{IsFunctor}(v^*_{\\mathrm{Mod}},\\mathrm{Mod}_{\\mathbb T}(\\mathcal C),\\mathrm{Mod}_{\\mathbb T}(\\mathcal D)),\\\\\n\\operatorname{IsFunctor}(v^*_{\\mathrm{Geom}},\\mathrm{Geom}(\\mathcal C,\\mathcal B),\\mathrm{Geom}(\\mathcal D,\\mathcal B)),\\\\\nA_v\\coloneqq v^*_{\\mathrm{Mod}}\\circ\\operatorname{Ev}_M^{\\mathcal C},\\qquad\nB_v\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Ev}_M^{\\mathcal D}\\circ v^*_{\\mathrm{Geom}},\\qquad A_v=B_v,\\\\\n\\kappa_v^M\\coloneqq\\left(A_v,B_v,\\left(1_{A_v(f)}\\right)_{f\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathrm{Geom}(\\mathcal C,\\mathcal B))}\\right),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{IsNaturalIso}(\\kappa_v^M,A_v,B_v).\n\\end{gathered}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{gathered}\n(\\mathbf1^{\\mathrm{Geom}}_{\\mathcal E})^*_{\\mathrm{Mod}}=1_{\\mathrm{Mod}_{\\mathbb T}(\\mathcal E)},\\qquad\n(\\mathbf1^{\\mathrm{Geom}}_{\\mathcal E})^*_{\\mathrm{Geom}}=1_{\\mathrm{Geom}(\\mathcal E,\\mathcal B)},\\\\\n(h\\diamond g)^*_{\\mathrm{Mod}}=h^*_{\\mathrm{Mod}}\\circ g^*_{\\mathrm{Mod}},\\qquad\n(h\\diamond g)^*_{\\mathrm{Geom}}=h^*_{\\mathrm{Geom}}\\circ g^*_{\\mathrm{Geom}},\\\\\n\\kappa_{\\mathbf1^{\\mathrm{Geom}}_{\\mathcal E}}^M=1_{\\operatorname{Ev}_M^{\\mathcal E}},\\qquad\n\\kappa_{h\\diamond g}^M=(\\kappa_h^M g^*_{\\mathrm{Geom}})\\circ(h^*_{\\mathrm{Mod}}\\kappa_g^M).\n\\end{gathered}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{gathered}\n\\beta_{\\mathrm{Mod}}\\coloneqq\\left(g^*_{\\mathrm{Mod}},(g')^*_{\\mathrm{Mod}},\n\\left((\\operatorname{Inv}_g(N),\\operatorname{Inv}_{g'}(N),(\\beta_{N_s})_{s\\in S_0})\\right)_{N\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathrm{Mod}_{\\mathbb T}(\\mathcal E))}\\right),\\\\\n\\beta_{\\mathrm{Geom}}\\coloneqq\\left(g^*_{\\mathrm{Geom}},(g')^*_{\\mathrm{Geom}},\n\\left((g\\diamond f,g'\\diamond f,\\beta f^*)\\right)_{f\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathrm{Geom}(\\mathcal E,\\mathcal B))}\\right),\\\\\n\\operatorname{IsNatural}(\\beta_{\\mathrm{Mod}},g^*_{\\mathrm{Mod}},(g')^*_{\\mathrm{Mod}}),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{IsNatural}(\\beta_{\\mathrm{Geom}},g^*_{\\mathrm{Geom}},(g')^*_{\\mathrm{Geom}}),\\\\\n\\kappa_{g'}^M\\circ(\\beta_{\\mathrm{Mod}}\\operatorname{Ev}_M^{\\mathcal E})\n=(\\operatorname{Ev}_M^{\\mathcal F}\\beta_{\\mathrm{Geom}})\\circ\\kappa_g^M.\n\\end{gathered}","display":true}],"bytes":5333,"backlinks":[{"id":"c53146be63465990","anchor":"ref-291","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-generic-model-pseudonaturality|Theorem — 泛模型分类的伪自然性]]"},{"id":"4741fef73eb1a614","anchor":"ref-227","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-generic-model-pseudonaturality]]"},{"id":"c60ad289d123497b","anchor":"ref-292","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-generic-model-pseudonaturality|Theorem — 泛模型分类的伪自然性]]"}],"outgoing":["a76b2bc2c7b718cf","a987285ba9cb0966","9fefe9c472fa2311","6f0a11402a38ca6b","c502117a84587a7c","fc5aaf8518e020c2","f012515fd4cf0061","dad26c5de724390a","637a464575207be3","86c3a123f8ca1262"]}